,"d":"2018-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curtis Espeland","x":"In addition, we're implementing price increases in our copolyester products to mostly offset the substantial increases in paraxylene costs that occurred through the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2018 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2019-02-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So the trade war gets completely resolved, that's going to be upside for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2018 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2019-02-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So those customers who were worried about where the trade war was headed, they started -- because they didn't think they can handle the 25% increase on January 1, they started aggressively destocking and really taking inventories down to almost zero and would only order raws when they received an…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2018 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2019-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"And given the large drop in Brent beginning in October, we had a harder time raising our prices, but we still had $90 million of higher raw material and distribution costs year-over-year due to the third quarter flowing through our inventories.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2018 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2019-02-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So you had raws go up quite a bit with oil through the third quarter, that flowing through very slowly in the fourth quarter and we lost our ability to raise prices to offset it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2018 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2019-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"With this vulcanizing agent, tire manufacturers can improve productivity, achieve better operational control and realize cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2018 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2019-02-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So if you look at 2014 through 2017, we did about a $1 billion of cost savings productivity that allows to completely offset inflation in that time period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2018-earnings-conferenc.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So when you get in this trade war issue, a lot of those producers really lost confidence in their ability to sort of export back to the US because they fear the trade and tariffs going back to 25%, that's what held them up in the third quarter -- I'm sorry, in the fourth quarter last year, as…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"…producers really lost confidence in their ability to sort of export back to the US because they fear the trade and tariffs going back to 25%, that's what held them up in the third quarter -- I'm sorry, in the fourth quarter last year, as well as the uncertainty what would happen on March 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"Lower selling prices year-over-year were largely attributed to care chemicals due to cost pass-through contracts producing stable earnings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"To a lesser extent, excluding the care chemicals cost pass-through contracts, prices were relatively flat sequentially with higher costs raw material flow through creating some pressure on spreads year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"As always, we also continue to aggressively execute on cost management running a highly productive organization and we've increased our cost reduction actions given the short-term macroeconomic challenges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"For the full-year, we expect acetate tow volume declines consistent with the underlying market, plus the impact of the headwinds from China trade issues from the first half of the year, offset by growth in textile market and cost reduction actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2019-04-26","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"David Begleiter","x":"You maintained the full-year guidance, can you talk about that dynamic and why you didn't take the opportunity now to trim the full year guide given the challenging macro?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2019-07-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark K. Cox","x":"So if the trade war gets resolved or stimulus in China works despite a neutral trade situation, it starts getting the business confidence and China confidence back up that drives China growth back into gear, which also will improve European economy as well in a substantial way, you will get a…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2019-07-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So while the timing is not great, if this had happened -- this trade war had happened two years from now into the future, it'll look more like AM.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2019-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"Pricing was somewhat lower with the largest contributor being cost pass-through contracts in Care Chemicals and a few other products with the remainder due to competitive rivalry in the adhesives and tire additives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2019-07-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So when you look at a price decline of 3%, half of that, as we told you, is cost pass-through contracts predominantly in Care Chemicals and then a few other products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2019-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark K. Cox","x":"We obviously have taken cost out, and so you get the fixed cost leverage that comes with that as well as you go into next year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2019-07-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"And then the cost reduction activities will help benefit that businesses like all the rest of the segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/26/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2019-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"If there is a trade war settlement, we will do a lot better than that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2019-10-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"I think there is a lot of volatility uncertainty out there, where you go back and forth between an escalation that trade war in August and where there is Phase 1 progress that's debatable in October and there's just a lot of uncertainty that's impacting business and consumer confidence out there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2019-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"…selling prices were primarily due to lower raw material prices with about 50% -- 40% of the decline from cost pass-through contracts and the remainder attributed to increased competitive pressure, particularly for adhesives resins, tire additives and formic acid that serves several end markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2019-10-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Curt E. Espeland","x":"Turning to the sequential comparison, sales increased as higher volume and better product mix was mostly offset by lower prices, particularly for Care Chemical cost pass-through contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"As we discussed before in this challenging business environment, we continue to achieve our cost reduction targets where we stay focused on innovation to create our own growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2019-10-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"These lower volumes are resulting in lower capacity utilization than we had expected, and the fixed cost hit of the utilization is mostly offsetting the cost savings from our productivity actions we took in the first half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2020-01-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"This reflects the fact that these spreads in 2019 declined through the year, especially as a trade war escalated, and therefore we enter this year at a lower level relative to the first half of '19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2020-01-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"If you look at the two specialty businesses, we've had before the trade war started, over $600 million EBITDA growth from '14 to '18, one third of that was acquisition, but two thirds of it was organic growth that came from these acquisitions, as well as the core Eastman businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2020-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"But when we look at the core alklyamine platform, which is what we are centering acquiring care chemicals, has delivered really strong growth and very stable margins as you just highlighted, with cost pass-through contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2020-01-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"…the two-thirds did quite well as Curt laid out, prices were relatively flat outside of the cost pass-through contracts, and we expect that continue this year, where prices will be stable and we saw a raw material benefits as a result, we saw volume growth and we have this headwind, especially…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2020-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"These actions could be restructuring, partnerships or potential divestment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2019 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2020-01-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"Certainly, we're looking at everything we can do on the restructuring front, and driving both innovation as well as how it optimizes the cost structure in this environment, and then we're looking at partnering and divestment options, as things we consider.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/31/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2019-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"This quarter demonstrates what Eastman can do when we have a day of sunlight between the trade war starting to moderate and COVID starting to escalate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"I certainly think that if we look all the way back to 2018, when you get to before the trade war started and that then got followed on by COVID-19, I mean, you can't really make this up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"There are some cost pass-through contracts in Care Chemicals and coatings that we'll pass on some of those raws, but the spreads will be stable, which is in the end, all we want from a long-term point of view.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"That's about 2% of the 6% for the overall segment as those cost pass-through contracts for the first quarter, as an example.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"The thing I want to add beyond just the restructuring activities, and we intend to be aggressive there and hopefully make some decisions here soon about our asset footprint, the innovation is actually very attractive to potential interested parties and actually going quite well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"It's all part of restructuring the business and improving it while we have it as well as making it more valuable to other people.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2020-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So we are withdrawing our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/01/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2020-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"And as you think about the trade war question, sometimes we forget, we're interested in phase 2, we started with the trade war in '19, and a pandemic just to make it more interesting this year on top of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2020-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"And we're already living with a certain amount of trade war that didn't exactly get completely abated, you've got stabilized, I would say in the beginning of this year, but it didn't go away.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"We expect this will decline by about half in the third quarter and be partially offset by increasing maintenance spending and a moderation of the impact from cost reduction actions as we ramp back up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2020-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Angel Castillo","x":"So you're doing some savings, cost savings initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/04/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q2-2020-earnings-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2020-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"Unless I forget, we started with a trade war and then COVID.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2020-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"The ADD tariffs that got put in place shoving China tires back into China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So, as you think about 2021, we will not only generate cost savings that offset any of the discretionary that's flowing back.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"David Begleiter","x":"Mark, just on your cost savings, I believe about $100 million of these $150 million are somewhat temporary interim cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q3-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2021-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"Significant portion of our headwinds in 2019 with the trade war as well as 2020 with COVID-19 were related to mix.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2021-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"…isn't just about '19 and '20, but it goes all the way back to '18 when you think about, first, we had a trade war that really hit some high-value markets for us and impacted earnings, then we piled on a pandemic, and we see us recovering back to '19 volumes and mix and hopefully better than that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2020 Q4","e":"emn","d":"2021-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Bob Koort","x":"So, Willie, is the cliff notes then if this, the raw material inflation is demand based, then you're OK with that because it allows you to pass it through more easily?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q4-2020-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2021-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Sison","x":"So 2019 and 2020, with the impact of COVID and before that, the China trade war, we saw a pretty significant drop in volume and mix, it also led to drop in raw material prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"In addition, we have price increases that are continuing to catch up to higher raw material, energy and distribution costs in some products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2021-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"And the vast majority of that business is on cost pass-through contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2021-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William McLain","x":"We continue to be disciplined, and we're making progress on the restructuring activities to improve these businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/30/eastman-chemical-co-emn-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"They're mostly on cost pass-through contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So, we have a lot of that business on cost pass-through contracts versus spot because we want predictable earnings that really showed a lot of benefit in how well CI held up on an annual basis in '19 and '20, relative to '18.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kevin McCarthy","x":"William T. McLain, Jr.: What I would highlight is we've had three primary buckets that we've talked about of cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"So I think that's quite stable when you consider the China trade war and the pandemic and sort of recovering out of it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"…will be -- with the price actions we're taking through the fourth quarter and a lot of effective price increases on January one in businesses, you're going to see a pretty big step-up in earnings there from spreads getting better as long as you believe raw materials are going to plateau…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"AFP has done a better job of sort of keeping track with prices this year because they have a lot more cost pass-through contracts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"And I'm proud of our teams delivering on that restructuring activity, which is never easy to sort of get to where we are.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2021 Q3","e":"emn","d":"2021-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark J. Costa","x":"And we have a very aggressive transformation program going that when you look at operational transformation cost cutting plus variable comp tailwind, that's about $200 million of tailwind that offsets about $80 million to $100 million of inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/eastman-chemical-company-emn-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2026-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"We don't see a big spike in demand like last year where people are just trying to buy stuff ahead of tariff risk.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/eastman-emn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2026-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"William McLain","x":"Matt, on the IEEPA tariffs, obviously, with the Supreme Court ruling and the Court of International Trade, we recognized about $20 million within Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/eastman-emn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2026-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"As our competitors in Asia, principally are facing a much higher oil costs, much higher natural gas cost they're having to raise prices like we are aggressively in this context.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/eastman-emn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2026-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"There are shortages out there that's driving all this price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/eastman-emn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2026-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"And then you have the cost savings and a lot of the utilization benefit is going to be in the back half, too.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/eastman-emn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q1","e":"emn","d":"2026-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"So that starts translating into materially improving margins as well as a utilization better than last year without the inventory management of last year. and cost reduction activities that have been pretty significant in '25 and '26.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/eastman-emn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2026-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"We told you that we had about a $30 million headwind last year relative to '24 with the drop in the textile business, which was a combination of a weak market made even weaker by tariffs impacting demand and our price point going into China.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/eastman-emn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"EMN 2026 Q2","e":"emn","d":"2026-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Costa","x":"The volumes were relatively low and a very tough comp to last year because volumes in textiles were high in the first half of last year and then really came off in the back half